@startuml
!include act_style.iuml
|Student|
start
:Open subject and select an
ABSENT meeting;
:Enter reason and attach file
(JPG, PNG or PDF);
:Click "Submit Excuse";
|CheckedIn System|
if (Within 7 days, file valid (<= 5 MB)\nand no pending excuse?) then (no)
  :Show error message;
  |Student|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Cloudinary|
:Store file as private asset;
:Return secure URL and public ID;
|CheckedIn System|
:Save excuse request (PENDING);
|Professor|
:Open pending excuses list;
|CheckedIn System|
:Generate signed URL (10-minute expiry);
|Cloudinary|
:Deliver file;
|Professor|
:Review document;
if (Decision?) then (Approve)
  |CheckedIn System|
  :Set excuse APPROVED;
  :Set attendance record = EXCUSED (blue);
  :Recompute absence hours;
else (Reject)
  |CheckedIn System|
  :Set excuse REJECTED and save note;
  :Record stays ABSENT;
endif
|Brevo Email API|
:Send excuse result email to student;
|CheckedIn System|
:Write notification log;
|Student|
:See updated status on
attendance page;
stop
@enduml
